From: Roman Kuraev <naoru.desu@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 00:06:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] linux-postmarketos-qcom-sm8250: DisplayPort sleep follow-ups

Replace kernel patch 0145 with Jesse Casco's posted fix for the same bug (skip PUSH_IDLE when the link was never enabled). Add 0157, Dmitry Baryshkov's patch that stops the HPD plug handler from taking a reference on repeated plug events, and 0158, Joonhoe Kim's patch that holds one runtime PM reference per plugged state, so the DP controller can suspend after the display is unplugged. Advance to release 89.
